{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potion &amp; Fortune</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Potion &amp; Fortune</i>, you take on the role of a gnome wizard who\u2019s lost his powers and starts anew in a quaint town, using his wits and alchemy to make a name for himself. Craft unique potions from rare ingredients, uncover hidden recipes, and sell your concoctions to eager customers. Venture into enchanted forests and dark dungeons to hunt for ingredients, fending off monsters along the way. As you gather resources and experiment with brews, your magic grows stronger, and your staff can be upgraded to take on even fiercer foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potion Crafting &amp; Selling</strong> \u2013 Brew potions with diverse effects and sell them to the townsfolk. From simple remedies to powerful elixirs, each sale brings you closer to rediscovering your lost magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/2799bd5a96d5a484aa9c1e58dd77ab00.poster.avif?t=1770809543\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/2799bd5a96d5a484aa9c1e58dd77ab00.webm?t=1770809543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/2799bd5a96d5a484aa9c1e58dd77ab00.mp4?t=1770809543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ingredient Hunting &amp; Monster Slaying</strong> \u2013 Collect ingredients across rich environments, battling monsters and discovering hidden spots brimming with mystical plants and minerals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/28bf3b726bd177a2af00a98e99413d3d.poster.avif?t=1770809543\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/28bf3b726bd177a2af00a98e99413d3d.webm?t=1770809543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Magic Staff</strong> \u2013 Customize and enhance your staff with elemental powers and special abilities to take on tougher enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/3caec37340e3fded964c2091bda9244a.poster.avif?t=1770809543\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/3caec37340e3fded964c2091bda9244a.webm?t=1770809543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/3caec37340e3fded964c2091bda9244a.mp4?t=1770809543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Storyline &amp; Charming World </strong>\u2013Meet seven unique customers in a cozy yet mysterious town. Choose wisely\u2014some may use your potions for good, others for harm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/e1ebdb47144b919793e5d7ebfb9001d2.poster.avif?t=1770809543\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/e1ebdb47144b919793e5d7ebfb9001d2.webm?t=1770809543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/e1ebdb47144b919793e5d7ebfb9001d2.mp4?t=1770809543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you reclaim your powers and bring <i>Potion &amp; Fortune</i> to the small town, or will you be lost in the endless pursuit of the perfect brew?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3343040?t=1770809543","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770809543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/0130d66bbc3d5b67b8237c91d002824deaf35f10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770809543","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/0130d66bbc3d5b67b8237c91d002824deaf35f10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770809543","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potion &amp; Fortune</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Potion &amp; Fortune</i>, you take on the role of a gnome wizard who\u2019s lost his powers and starts anew in a quaint town, using his wits and alchemy to make a name for himself. Craft unique potions from rare ingredients, uncover hidden recipes, and sell your concoctions to eager customers. Venture into enchanted forests and dark dungeons to hunt for ingredients, fending off monsters along the way. As you gather resources and experiment with brews, your magic grows stronger, and your staff can be upgraded to take on even fiercer foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potion Crafting &amp; Selling</strong> \u2013 Brew potions with diverse effects and sell them to the townsfolk. From simple remedies to powerful elixirs, each sale brings you closer to redis